        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 143.85,
          "en": "So you know how to create the models.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.85,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "And we talk about the MVC patterns and all.",
