          "end": 155.52,
          "en": "So when we're using eloquent we have to use the models for communicate with with the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 155.52,
          "end": 160.59,
          "en": "But in case of query builder we can directly hit the database and get the database table and get the",
