        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 160.59,
          "end": 163.02,
          "en": "data or run our operations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 163.05,
          "end": 169.56,
          "en": "Anyways, both of the uh, builders have, uh, really great features, like if we write any kind of",
          "zh": ""
