          "end": 304.57,
          "en": "Uh, we don't have to run long queries normally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 304.57,
          "end": 311.29,
          "en": "You know that when we, uh, in raw, raw queries, when we are trying to insert anything in our database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
